Bind Npc 24407 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14407 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 792 "[Crack of All Means] Drug to the Pharmacist"
    Journal for karus "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Gater."
    Journal for elmorad "You must accept the request of [Order of the Sorcery] Nez."
    Collect 1 of 900330000

Requires player level >= 55 and quest 791 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "We have to go back to Luferson Castle and meet [Advisor] Herga. Let's go, Master."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "We have to go back to El Morad Castle and meet [Advisor] Nez. Let's go, Master."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You've come back. So what's happened?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Antibiotic creation has been completed? Good job, <selfname>. [Completed Antibiotics]...\n\nDeliver [Complete Antibiotic] to Luferson Castle's Herga following the request from Gator."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You've come back. So what's happened?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Antibiotic creation has been completed? Good job, <selfname>. [Completed Antibiotics]...\n\nDeliver [Complete Antibiotic] to Luferson Castle's Herga following the request from Noker."

On in_progress
    Say "So where is it?"

On claimable
    Show quest "Give it to me. I'll see how we can distribute this before the disease spreads.\n\nFirst, get this [Timing Flow (Taion)]. Equip this and vaccinate [Taion]. It'll only work on [Taion]."
